# FurShield

- Stack is Laravel 12, Blade, Alpine.js 3, Tailwind CSS 3, and Vite. Do not add React, Vue, or Inertia, and do not suggest migrating the stack.
- Reuse Blade components in `resources/views/components/ui`. Do not repeat long utility-class strings in views.
- Animate with the vanilla Motion library and CSS only. Every animation must respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Accessibility: visible focus states, labels bound to inputs, `aria-label` on icon-only buttons, and text contrast of at least 4.5:1.
- Every screen needs loading (skeleton), empty, error, and success states.
- Put business logic in `app/Services`, not in controllers or views. Wrap multi-step writes in `DB::transaction`.
- Before any UI work, read `PRODUCT.md`, `DESIGN.md`, and `design-system/MASTER.md`.
- After every task, run `npm run build` and `php artisan test`, then list the files you changed.

